  "preText": "",
  "text": "<strong>chips a catch to midwicket! Stokes' belief in Moeen pays off</strong>. Horror shot from Head. He skipped down the track to loft again but wasn't quite there and just chipped it meekly off the inside half of the bat to midwicket. Simple catch for Crawley. The crowd is alive again",
  "postText": "<strong>Drinks</strong> Just as Australia were taking control, Head gifts his wicket away. Big moment for Moeen Ali and Ben Stokes who backed him despite his expense. Green walks in. KK to come into commentary.",
  "shortText": "Ali to Head, OUT",
